Third-party material
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The Flutter client under client_flutter/ originates from the "restaurant
finder" sample in Google's genui repository, which is also licensed under the
Apache License, Version 2.0:

    Copyright 2024 Google LLC

Files derived from that sample keep their original Apache 2.0 headers and the
Google copyright line, as the licence requires. As of this release the client
is still substantially the upstream sample; it is being replaced with the
finance catalog under Epic 1 (GGU-7), and headers on files rewritten from
scratch carry the Somnio copyright instead.

The client depends on the genui packages (genui, genui_a2a, a2ui_core)
published by Google, and the backend speaks the A2A protocol. Those are
dependencies and protocol implementations, not vendored source, and are
governed by their own licences.
